    "detailed_description": "<strong> Adapted according to the real event of a programmer running away! </strong><br><br>This is a rpg adventure real-time combat game combined with strategy!<br><br>You will act as the boss of an independent game studio to maintain the business<br><br>Research and develop &quot;Yidao 999&quot; to burn pigs in stone tombs, research and develop &quot;Yuanmo&quot; to challenge Slim, and &quot;Orcs contend for hegemony&quot; tribes and alliances!<br><br>&quot;Pig Three Stones&quot;, &quot;Rice Kouyou&quot;, three swordsmen and &quot;Goosla&quot; will all appear in the game<br><br>Be careful of that programmer, he may kill you at the critical moment!<br><br><br><br><strong> Chessboard exploration: </strong><br><br>Use your walking strategy reasonably, avoid numerous traps, and explore the world in the fog<br><br><strong> Up Main union: </strong><br><br>In the game, a large number of up players are made into npcs (authorized). You will meet them in the adventure and invite them to join the team to develop the game with you<br><br><strong> Hair style system: </strong><br><br>Your hair will become less every time you die, and you will become bald and strong! But when the light is 0, you will &quot;die forever\u201c<br><br><strong> Meat pigeon </strong><br><br>The way you acquire skills and talents is random, and there will be randomly generated checkpoints in the later stage!",
